Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Name independent investigators and label the
 investigation hand-off

Investigators of an --investigation team have KIND=investigation but no
investigation number (phase 1) or their own task ID as INV_ID (phases
2/3), and no requesting agent. The dashboard, the panel, the watcher's
events and `agent status`/`agent show` treated them like
request_investigation runs, so the main page showed
"investigator # (inv-opus)", "inv#" and a dangling "for" instead of the
real agent.

live reads INVESTIGATION_TEAM into Task.InvestigationTeam; Label() and
the web row show the agent's name for those tasks, and the "for <agent>"
stage is added only when an agent requested the investigation. Legacy
investigations keep "investigator #N (agent)" and "inv#N".

human_on_pr hard-coded "--autopilot"; it now takes the mode, and the
investigation hand-off says "--investigation complete: ...".

make lint test: 0 issues, all tests pass.

